Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 14:15:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD reviewed patch completion prompts to close or reopen
 agents

Clean reviews prompt the reviewed patch agent for a done confirmation so completed work can leave the active terminal list while follow-up messages still reopen the original agent conversation.
