 lines and common natural-language requests for help, review, linearization, quitting, and launching
@@ -313,6 +322,11 @@ state for that session. `TerminalUi` queues one terminal bell when a chat transi
 state and renders ready rows in reverse video so they remain highlighted until the chat becomes busy
 again.
 
+Closed feature sessions are hidden from the terminal left pane. The terminal app keeps the most
+recently closed patch-agent session as a pending reopen target so typing a follow-up message after a
+`yes` confirmation reopens and selects that session. Manual selection of a different chat clears the
+pending reopen target, so a later message goes to the visible selected chat.
+
